        "path": "VisionDemo/src/main/java/com/visiondemo/service/OrderService.java",
        "before": "    public Page<Order> search(String status, String supplier, int page, int size) {\n        return orderRepository.search(status, supplier, PageRequest.of(page, size));\n    }\n",
        "after": "    public Page<Order> search(String status, String supplier, int page, int size) {\n        String normalizedStatus = status == null || status.isBlank() ? null : status;\n        String normalizedSupplier = supplier == null || supplier.isBlank() ? null : supplier.trim();\n        return orderRepository.search(normalizedStatus, normalizedSupplier, PageRequest.of(page, size));\n    }\n"
      }
    ],
